/* Eaves — English (development language).
 *
 * Keys are semantic and stable; the values on the right are what people see.
 * To add a language, copy this file to Resources/<code>.lproj/Localizable.strings,
 * translate the right-hand side only, and add <code> to CFBundleLocalizations
 * in build.sh. Copy Localizable.stringsdict too — it holds the one string that
 * needs plural rules.
 */

